      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(The lights are on, and everything around me looks normal.)",
        "zh": "（灯光是亮着的，周边看起来也没有异样。）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 3
