    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_惊醒",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Was I having a nightmare?",
        "zh": "是我做了噩梦？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(But those faces, and that pain... it all felt so real. I still can't forget it. Was all of that really just a dream?)",
        "zh": "（可那些人的脸，还有那种疼痛……太真实了，我现在都还忘不掉。这难道全部都是梦吗？）",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 9
    },
    {
