      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(And in that brief moment just now, I thought I saw some kind of pattern again.)",
        "zh": "（而且，刚才那一瞬间，我好像又看见了什么图案。）",
        "ja": ""
