      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(It looked like some sort of ritual marking, or maybe... neatly arranged limbs.)",
        "zh": "（像是某种祭祀用的纹样，又像……被摆放整齐的肢体。）",
        "ja": ""
