      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "(No, that's not right. The figure at the center of that pattern... why did it look so much like me?)",
        "zh": "（不，不对。那图案中央的人影……为什么那么像我？）",
        "ja": ""
